# "round X ..." changes X; "rounded to 2 decimals" is "decimal places" (proposal 0020).
let density be 4.8 divided by 20.
round density to 2 decimal places.
say density.
let price be 3.14159.
round price to 3 decimals.
say price.
let total be 7.5.
round total.
say total.
let x be 2.2.
round x up.
say x.
let y be 2.8.
round y down.
say y.
say 2.71828 rounded to 1 decimal.
a box has a weight.
let b be a new box with weight 2.567.
round b's weight to 1 decimal place.
say b's weight.
